                                "sense_id": "f90aeec9-6a08-3b57-936e-a6ecc6fcedda",
                                "text": "\"She's coming out,\" screamed the smallest boy, with the whitest face, the most beetrooty nose, the thinnest blouse, and the most precocious intellect ever seen or heard of."
