                                "sense_id": "f90aeec9-6a08-3b57-936e-a6ecc6fcedda",
                                "text": "Swelling up with a beetrooty apoplectic rage, the Councillor seized the white silk chair and, swinging it by the arms, banged it violently against the floor […]"
